GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/repetisions/1
### Add new repetision
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/repetisions

{
   "repetisionName":"HOURLY",
   "inHours":"1"
}
### Delete repetision with id 5
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/repetisions/5






